# TODO: Restructure all makefile targets according to the following guidelines

# Setup
# - Prepares the environment or dependencies.
# - Typical subtasks: virtual environments, package installation, prerequisites check.

# Apply
# Performs the principal project tasks, e.g., compilation, scripts, data transformations.
# Should not modify system paths or deploy artifacts.

# Install
# Makes executables or scripts available, either by copying or creating symbolic links.

# All-encompassing Targets
# all: runs setup, apply, and install in sequence.

# Clean
# Removes temporary files or build artifacts.

# Uninstall = Undo Install
# Remove deployed files, binaries, or symlinks 

# Reset = Undo Setup
